akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449390/extras/2PattsV2.gif?t=1750849811\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449390/extras/Master_TitleENG.png?t=1750849811\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a combat system based on card speed. Master the action times of each enemy to establish a winning strategy!  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449390/extras/ActionBarMove3.gif?t=1750849811\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn how to use the different types of cards and control their activation speed, thus dealing strong blows or applying curious altered states to your enemies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449390/extras/Events_TitleENG.png?t=1750849811\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with the different random events scattered throughout the city's neighborhoods, where you can learn more about the characters. But be careful, depending on the decisions you make, you could even end up harmed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449390/extras/EventoSTEAM.gif?t=1750849811\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449390/extras/Features_Banner_eng.png?t=1750849811\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create different types of decks! More than 100 cards that will allow you to build them according to your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Card usage and enemy actions are determined by speed! Master this dynamic speed system to put your strategic timing skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interrogate all the citizens! Up to 30 unique characters that roam the streets of Tubercle City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new zones! The city is formed by 3 playable zones, each one with its own culture, society and rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip several gadgets! Throughout the city you will discover powerful items that improve your deck and may create interesting synergies...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Investigate every neighborhood! Like the great detective that you are, you must discover every last citizen and card there is.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449390/extras/Steam_Separator.png?t=1750849811\" /></div></p></li></ul>","developers":["Poison Pill Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449390/282010a58887fc5f1b26bc3b6861fac410a4d6c6/header.jpg?t=1750849811","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2023 Poison Pill Games S.L","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257159137,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159137/movie480.mp4?t=1750405328","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257159137/movie_max.mp4?t=1750405328"},"name":"Trailer Release Vegangsters","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257159137/42c166388c24c6a4d3c9562c3e3d515d8f4cb93e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=